### Local tooling ###
# .claude holds per-machine run configuration. It was ignored WHOLESALE because
# launch.json hardcoded absolute paths and was meaningless on anyone else's machine
# — true of the file as it stood, and the wrong fix: the run configuration is the
# one piece of local tooling every contributor needs, and ignoring it meant a fresh
# clone had no way to start the services at all.
#
# M3 D17: the paths are now relative to the repository root, so the file is
# portable and is tracked. Everything else under .claude/ stays ignored, because
# settings.local.json and friends genuinely are per-machine.
#
# The frontend's dev server is NOT here. It lives in its own repository and is
# launched from its own .claude/launch.json — a path reaching across two repos
# would have been absolute again by another name.
.claude/*
!.claude/launch.json

